<title>UK: NatWest's Gray to run Lombard and Ulster Bk.</title>
<headline>NatWest's Gray to run Lombard and Ulster Bk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Westminster Bank Plc said on Thursday that Martin Gray will become executive director of its units Lombard Group and Ulster Bank with effect from March 1, 1997.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Gray will maintain responsibilities as chief executive of NatWest UK.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
